  "priorExpiration": "2006-11-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3802.02 Information on Form DSMV 428.\n\n(a) The law enforcement officer shall furnish the following on form DSMV 428:\n\n(1) The name and address of the court having jurisdiction in which the violation occurred;\n\n(2) Whether the defendant is required to appear in person at the court;\n\n(3) The defendant's name, address and date of birth;\n\n(4) The defendant's sex, race, height, weight, hair color and eye color;\n\n(5) The defendant's license number, license class and state of issuance;\n\n(6) The date and location of the violation;\n\n(7) The registration number, plate, make, year and type of motor vehicle;\n\n(8) Whether the vehicle involved is a commercial vehicle;\n\n(9) Whether the defendant's license is a commercial driver license;\n\n(10) Whether the violation involved hazardous materials;\n\n(11) Whether the vehicle involved has a capacity of 16 or more passengers;\n\n(12) The specific violation; and\n\n(13) The law enforcement officer’s name, department and badge number or identification number.\n\nSource. #5539, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6891, eff 11-25-98, EXPIRED: 11-25-06\n\nNew. #8823, eff 2-21-07; ss by #10825, eff 5-14-15",
